# base-fonts.packages — font families the base closure itself needs
#
# The default text and math fonts, installed in the Docker `base` stage so the
# formats built there resolve them. Every other family is installed in the
# throwaway `fonts` stage, from `fonts.packages`.
#
# Their files ship, so the base stage installs them with their doc files —
# .docker/fonts/README.md owns why a shipped font carries its license.
# `README.md` in the directory above owns the row format.

lm          Latin Modern, the default text font
lm-math     Latin Modern Math, the default math font
